### 3. “Pure” renderer service candidates — imports

| File | Pure? | Imports |
|---|---|---|
| `crc32.ts` | **Yes** | None (self-contained table) |
| `pathSafety.ts` | **Yes** | `path` only |
| `tocReader.ts` | **No** | `fs`, `./crc32`, Node `zlib` (`:17-22`) |
| `clientSearchOrder.ts` | **No** | `path`, `fs` (require), `./clientLayout` (`:31-37`); `clientLayout` also uses `fs` (`clientLayout.ts:33-34`) |

Design’s “consider moving if pure” is only fully true for **`crc32.ts`** and **`pathSafety.ts`**.

