### 4. UI wiring table (§9)

| Row | Verdict | Evidence |
|---|---|---|
| Lint findings → VFS + Inspect stack | **WRONG target + no current UI** | No per-entry defect badges; no archive lint summary. Wrong inspector: use **`DataPanel`/`IffStructureTree`**, not `InspectorStack`. `defects` stripped before store (`TreVfsBrowser.tsx:386-390`). |
| Shadow/override/tombstone provenance | **CONFIRMED + mostly already wired** | `VfsTree.tsx`: `isOverride`, `shadowCount`, `isTombstone`, `⧉`/`⊘` (`:698-732`); **winner archive filename already shown** per row (`:734-750`, `title={entry.winnerArchivePath}`). `ShadowChainDetail` in tree detail (`VfsTree.tsx:541`). “Add winner to tooltip where absent” understates existing winner pip. |
| Version/format facts → `MountedArchivesList` | **CONFIRMED** | Version chip `v4000`/`v5000`/`v6000` (`treMount.ts:44-48`, `MountedArchivesList.tsx:118-133`). |
| Enumerate-only chip “per-payload post-04.3” | **WRONG** | Detection is per-entry (`readVfsEntryBytes.ts:87` → `markArchiveEncrypted`), but chip is **per-archive** on `MountedArchivesList` (`:141-157`, `treStore.ts:271-278`). |
| Compose/deploy via stage flow | **CONFIRMED feasible** | `DeployDialog.tsx` calls `packPatch(flattenedEntries, outputPath)` (`:518`). Extension point exists; today emits **single `.tre`**, not TOC set. |
| Recipe/layer UI CLI-only | **CONFIRMED** | No compose/recipe UI in tree; aligns with “no half-rendered controls”. |

**InspectorStack card extensibility — WRONG assumption**  
Hard-coded appearance accordions (`InspectorStack.tsx:19-28`, mesh/materials/skeleton). Not a generic card stack for new lint/archive cards. VFS lint belongs in **`IffStructureTree`** / **`DataPanel`** or **`VfsTree`** row chrome.

---

### 5. Fixture / harness claims

**5.1 Registry sweep fails CI on zero fixtures / missing `loaderSource` — WRONG**  
Mechanism documented and implemented as `assertSweep()`, but **not wired into any test run** (see §1.9).

**5.2 `fixtures-real` + `skipIf` lane for running-client gate — RISK (mixed patterns, no client gate yet)**  
Patterns that exist:

- **Fail-loud:** `ilf-roundtrip.test.ts:217-218`, `ws-roundtrip.test.ts:314` — `expect(fixture).not.toBeNull()`
- **skipIf:** `tre-v6000-swgsource-byteexact.test.ts:83`, `stf-roundtrip.test.ts:302` (console SKIP), `objectTemplateResolver.test.ts:283` — `describe.skipIf(!hasReal)`

No implemented **running-client / FATAL-vs-boot** harness in code — only described in `.planning/handoff/2026-08-17-PROVIDER-REPLY-probe-artifacts-and-4000-census.md`. Design can copy patterns but cannot cite an existing running-client gate.

---

