**6.1 Record layout — CONFIRMED** against `tocReader.ts` and `tre-toc-extract-integration.test.ts`.

**6.2 “No write code the design missed” — RISK**  
No production writer. Test-only `buildSyntheticToc()` should be cited as B0 seed, not omitted.

